WEBVTT

NOTE
Glutenia promo film (26 s). Music only, no voice-over.
These cues describe the text and action on screen.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Music] Brown and green particles swirl together.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The particles form the Glutenia logo: a script wordmark with a wheat leaf.
"Gluten-free. Still a titan."

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
"For gluten-free people, every product is a label to decode."

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
An ingredient label appears: "Rice flour, sugar, wheat starch, palm oil, barley malt extract, salt, emulsifier (E471), farine de blé, cocoa. May contain traces of gluten."
Wheat starch, barley malt extract and farine de blé light up in red.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
"Gluten hides in plain sight. You can never just eat."
Glutitan, the mascot, raises a hand: stop.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
"Meet Glutenia. One app for the whole gluten-free journey."
1. AI label scan — Snap any ingredient label and get a clear gluten verdict, in English, French or Arabic.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
2. Gluten-free map — Find verified gluten-free shops, restaurants and events near you.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
3. Gluten-free shop — Order certified gluten-free products right in the app, from cart to doorstep.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.900
4. XP & badges — Join community events and earn XP, streaks and badges. Become a Glutitan.
